# merge 决策分支2：given 新增文件、current 未改该文件，采纳并暂存后提交
> init
<<<
+ base.txt mbase.txt
> add base.txt
<<<
> commit "base"
<<<
> branch other
<<<

# current 侧改动一个无关文件，形成真正分叉（split 既非两 head）
+ marker.txt mcur.txt
> add marker.txt
<<<
> commit "current side"
<<<

# given 侧新增 only.txt
> checkout other
<<<
+ only.txt monlygiven.txt
> add only.txt
<<<
> commit "given adds only"
<<<

> checkout master
<<<
> merge other
<<<

# only.txt 采纳为 given 版本；merge 后已提交，工作区干净
= only.txt monlygiven.txt
> status
=== Branches ===
*master
other

=== Staged Files ===

=== Removed Files ===

=== Modifications Not Staged For Commit ===

=== Untracked Files ===

<<<
